            "question": "What size should I get, and how should they fit?",
            "answer": "<p>Order your regular shoe size. They should feel snug, like a second skin, and there's no break-in period: how they feel on day one is how they feel. Narrow or wide feet can change your size, so check the <a href=\"/pages/performance-skins-size-chart\">size chart</a>. Want a personal recommendation? <a href=\"/pages/contact-us-form\">Send us your usual shoe size</a>.</p>"
