          "settings": {
            "category": "Fit & sizing",
            "question": "What if I'm between sizes?",
            "answer": "<p>Width decides. Don't just round up.</p><p>Wide feet often size up. Narrow feet often size down. Find your fit in the <a href=\"/pages/performance-skins-size-chart\">size guide</a>.</p><p>Color helps fine-tune. Black and Light Grey are the most forgiving for wider feet. Dark Grey, Hot Coral, and Blue run slightly snugger.</p>"
          }
        },
