          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Fit & sizing",
            "question": "Do certain colors fit differently?",
            "answer": "<p>Slightly. <strong>Dark Grey, Hot Coral, and Blue</strong> run a little snugger. <strong>Black and Light Grey</strong> are the most forgiving, especially for wider feet.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fit-5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Fit & sizing",
            "question": "Mine feel too tight, or too loose",
            "answer": "<p><strong>Too tight, or pressure on your toes:</strong> the size is likely too small. Move up one size.</p><p><strong>Too loose, or shifting as you move:</strong> likely too large. Move down one size. Already in our smallest size? A thin sock underneath gives you a snugger fit without affecting grip.</p><p>A <a href=\"/pages/returns-portal\">size exchange</a> is free and usually faster than a refund.</p>"
          }
        },
